  "description": "If there is one thing that Ma Jung-Woo is good at, it's football. Although he is a genius strategist, others look down on him because of his lack of education and debt. But things seem to turn around when he finds out he has just inherited his late grandfather's British football team. He plans to sell the team and start fresh, only to find out the team has massive debt! Left with no other choice, Jung-Woo must use his tactical genius to help this team rise from the ashes and be number one!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
